error[E0277]: `Sealed<String>` doesn't implement `std::fmt::Display`
 --> tests/ui/log_a_credential.rs:8:50
  |
8 |     let _by_display = format!("the credential is {sealed}");
  |                                                  ^^^^^^^^ `Sealed<String>` cannot be formatted with the default formatter
